    new "📋 Report copied. Paste it in Discord or send it by email. Thanks!"

    old "❌ No se pudo copiar. Sacá una captura de esta pantalla y mandála."
    new "❌ Couldn't copy. Take a screenshot of this screen and send it."

    old "📤 Reportar el error"
    new "📤 Report the error"

    old "📋 Copiar"
    new "📋 Copy"

    old "🔄 Reintentar"
    new "🔄 Retry"

    old "Continuar"
    new "Continue"
